  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAYMOTE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NAYMOTE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Citizens, especially women and youth in selected counties, are better informed and active in making demands for improved service delivery and for accountability of elected officials on election campaign promises in Liberia.

Outcome 2: Local government officials are more responsive to the needs of citizens, especially women and youth, in the use of social development funds to enhance local development within selected counties.

Outcome 3: Citizens have increased access to justice in rural communities through understanding of their rights and responsibilities,
and duties within the justice systems, legal support for engagement, and improved collaboration and partnership amongst the justice systems and beneficiary communities.

Outcome 4: Naymote has increased capacity and effective governance to accomplish its strategic plan for 20262030 and enhance organizational effectiveness to advance/impact democratic governance in Liberia and the ECOWAS subregion.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed contribution &apos;Democracy Advancement Program (DAP) is a project by
Naymote Partners for Democratic Development (Naymote) covering the period 1
September 2022 to 31 August 2025 with a total contribution of SEK 12 000 000. The
project has an overall goal &apos;To enhance democratic governance for inclusive
development in Liberia and has a specific objective to increase demand on the
government to deliver on its political, development and campaign promises.
The project aims to deliver the following three outcomes:
 Outcome 1: Citizens, especially women and youth in selected counties are better
informed and active in making demands for improved service delivery and for
accountability of elected officials on elections promises in Liberia.
Outcome 2: Local government officials are more responsive to the needs of citizens,
especially women and youth in the use of social development funds to enhance local
development within selected counties.
Outcome 3: Naymote has increased capacity to accomplish it strategic plan 2020-2025
and enhance organizational effectiveness to advance/impact democratic governance in
Liberia and the ECOWAS sub-region</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Democratic Advancement Program (DAP)&quot; &#xE4;r ett projekt av Naymote Partners for
Democratic Development (Naymote). Insatsen ska implementeras under perioden 1
september 2022 till 31 augusti 2025 med en total budget p&#xE5; 12 000 000 SEK. Projektets
&#xF6;vergripnade m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra demokratiskt styre f&#xF6;r en inkluderande utveckling i
Liberia. Vidare &#xE4;r ett specifikt m&#xE5;l att &#xF6;ka allm&#xE4;nhetens krav p&#xE5; regeringen att leva upp
till sina politiska l&#xF6;ften.
Projektet syftar till att uppfylla f&#xF6;ljande:
Resultat 1: Medborgare, s&#xE4;rskilt kvinnor och ungdomar i utvalda regioner, &#xE4;r b&#xE4;ttre
informerade och mer aktiva n&#xE4;r det g&#xE4;ller att st&#xE4;lla krav p&#xE5; f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrade samh&#xE4;llstj&#xE4;nster
samt att h&#xE5;lla valda f&#xF6;retr&#xE4;dare ansvariga f&#xF6;r sina vall&#xF6;ften.
Resultat 2: Lokala regeringsf&#xF6;retr&#xE4;dare &#xE4;r mer lyh&#xF6;rda till medborgares, fr&#xE4;mst kvinnors
och ungdomars, behov g&#xE4;llande anv&#xE4;ndning av &quot;Social Development Funds&quot; f&#xF6;r att
f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra lokal utveckling inom utvalda regioner.
Resultat 3: Naymote har &#xF6;kad kapacitet att genomf&#xF6;ra sin strategiska plan 2020-2025
samt har f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad organisatorisk effektivitet f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja/p&#xE5;verka demokratiskt styre i
Liberia och inom ECOWAS-regionen.</narrative>
  </description>
